SQL> SELECT avg(yellow_taxis.passenger_count) FROM yellow_tripdata LIMIT 10;
Response: "Column: avg(yellow_taxis.passenger_count) confirmed"
```

## Learnings and Recommendations
1. Validate CLI installation environment to pre-empt tar and gzip errors.
2. Incorporate robust error handling and detailed logging for installation commands.
3. Regularly monitor SQL REPL outputs to ensure ongoing system reliability.

## Next Steps
1. Refine installation scripts to handle decompression errors more gracefully.
2. Expand test cases for dataset file integrity and SQL query accuracy.
3. Schedule periodic environment cleanups and verifications to maintain system consistency.
